# Changes to CI, the release gate, its checkers, the policies they enforce, the claims and inventories they
# compare against, the database tests, and the instructions every coding agent reads first (AGENTS.md,
# CLAUDE.md) need the owner's review (ADR-0008). In a one-person project the
# workflow-guard job (base checkers judge the change) is what actually holds; CODEOWNERS adds the review
# once a second account exists. Owner set during first setup (docs/setup_guide.md, step 3).
/.github/                              @kafaat
/tools/                                @kafaat
/policies/                             @kafaat
/evals/                                @kafaat
/db/migrations/                        @kafaat
/db/tests/                             @kafaat
/db/local/                             @kafaat
/docs/claims.yaml                      @kafaat
/docs/error_codes.yaml                 @kafaat
/docs/security_definer_inventory.md    @kafaat
/requirements-ci.txt                   @kafaat
/VERSION                               @kafaat
/AGENTS.md                              @kafaat
/CLAUDE.md                              @kafaat
# The service's own hashed lock (ADR-0008; CI audits it with pip-audit). The owner's change-tier table treats
# every lock file as sensitive; this one is named *.txt, so it is listed by name.
/requirements-service.txt              @kafaat
# The owner's change-tier table (layer A, sensitive rules), at any depth, so that a matching file added later
# also needs the owner's review: agent configuration, the table itself, lock files, trust and review records,
# migrations, secrets, ownership files and agent instructions. Most match nothing today.
.github/                               @kafaat
.claude/                               @kafaat
/governance/                           @kafaat
*.lock*                                @kafaat
*-lock.*                               @kafaat
*_lock.*                               @kafaat
trust.json                             @kafaat
reviewed/                              @kafaat
migrations/                            @kafaat
secrets/                               @kafaat
CODEOWNERS                             @kafaat
AGENTS.md                              @kafaat
CLAUDE.md                              @kafaat
